From: Oliver Hartkopp <socketcan@hartkopp.net>
Date: Fri, 13 Feb 2026 14:52:19 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 24/28] can: isotp: move common definitions to separate header
 file

Create a new isotp_defines.h which is used by the upcoming code split.

Signed-off-by: Oliver Hartkopp <socketcan@hartkopp.net>
---
 net/can/isotp/isotp.c         | 103 +-----------------------------
 net/can/isotp/isotp_defines.h | 116 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 117 insertions(+), 102 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 net/can/isotp/isotp_defines.h

